stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Down: retained inflight row, one pending input
  Down --> Boot: restart with intake closed
  Boot --> Cleared: local namespace path + lstat ENOENT
  Boot --> Held: other host or live session or uncertain probe
  Cleared --> Open: recovery and watcher passes finish
  Held --> Protected: intake opens, row remains protected
  Open --> Admitted: same input claims once
  Admitted --> Admitted: duplicate create refused
